{
  "defaults": {
    "height": 864,
    "length": 124,
    "sampler_name": "res_multistep",
    "scheduler": "simple",
    "steps": 20,
    "width": 480
  },
  "description": "Workflow for MiniMax H3 text to video with native stereo sound",
  "groups": [{
    "id": 1,
    "member_nodes": ["10", "11", "12", "13", "note:1"],
    "title": "Model Loaders"
  }, {
    "id": 3,
    "member_nodes": ["1", "note:2"],
    "title": "Video Settings"
  }],
  "name": "MiniMax H3",
  "nodes": {
    "1": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Text to Video"
      },
      "class_type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "clip": ["11", 0],
        "height": "480",
        "length": "49",
        "prompt": "A \"red\" fox\nin snow \\ test",
        "vae": ["12", 0],
        "width": "832"
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Diffusion Model"
      },
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "unet.safetensors",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      }
    },
    "100": {
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "lora_name": "main_lora.safetensors",
        "model": ["10", 0],
        "strength_model": 0.800000011920929
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Text Encoder"
      },
      "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "clip_name": "clip.safetensors",
        "device": "default",
        "type": "minimax"
      }
    },
    "12": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Video VAE"
      },
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "vae.safetensors"
      }
    },
    "13": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Audio VAE"
      },
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "audio_vae.safetensors"
      }
    },
    "20": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Noise"
      },
      "class_type": "RandomNoise",
      "inputs": {
        "noise_seed": "1234567890123"
      }
    },
    "21": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Guider"
      },
      "class_type": "BasicGuider",
      "inputs": {
        "conditioning": ["1", 0],
        "model": ["100", 0]
      }
    },
    "22": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Sampler"
      },
      "class_type": "KSamplerSelect",
      "inputs": {
        "sampler_name": "dpmpp_2m"
      }
    },
    "23": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Scheduler"
      },
      "class_type": "BasicScheduler",
      "inputs": {
        "denoise": 1,
        "model": ["100", 0],
        "scheduler": "karras",
        "steps": "28"
      }
    },
    "24": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Sample"
      },
      "class_type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced",
      "inputs": {
        "guider": ["21", 0],
        "latent_image": ["1", 1],
        "noise": ["20", 0],
        "sampler": ["22", 0],
        "sigmas": ["23", 0]
      }
    },
    "25": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Decode Video"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEDecode",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["24", 0],
        "vae": ["12", 0]
      }
    },
    "26": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Decode Audio"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEDecodeAudio",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["24", 0],
        "vae": ["13", 0]
      }
    },
    "27": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Create Video"
      },
      "class_type": "CreateVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "audio": ["26", 0],
        "fps": 24,
        "images": ["25", 0]
      }
    },
    "28": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Save Video"
      },
      "class_type": "SaveVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "codec": "auto",
        "filename_prefix": "video/ComfyChair",
        "format": "auto",
        "video": ["27", 0]
      }
    }
  },
  "notes": [{
    "content": "### Recommended Models\n\n- **Diffusion model:** **MiniMax H3 FL2VA** (first/last frame to video, Int8)\n- **Text encoder:** **Qwen3-VL 32B** for MiniMax H3 (NVFP4 AWQ)\n- **VAE:** the MiniMax H3 **video** VAE\n- **Audio VAE:** the MiniMax H3 **audio** VAE\n\n---\n\n*MiniMax H3 generates the picture and its stereo sound together, at 24 fps.*",
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Model Selection"
  }, {
    "content": "### Recommended Settings\n\n- **Size:** 480 x 864 for speed, up to 768 x 1344 (the native canvas; multiples of 32)\n- **Length:** 124 frames (~5 s at 24 fps); 5 + 17n, trained on ~124-362\n\n---\n\n*Describe the shots, the motion and the sound (dialogue, effects, music) in one prompt. MiniMax H3 uses no negative prompt.*",
    "id": 2,
    "title": "Video Settings"
  }]
}
